<title>SWEDEN: Sydkraft sees slight profit drop in '96.</title>
<headline>Sydkraft sees slight profit drop in '96.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish power group Sydkraft AB posted on Friday first half profits in line with the same period last year, saying earnings for the year were likely to be slightly down on 1996.</p>
</text>
